## Title: TwizMage
## Notes: Mage helper: one key for Counterspell (in a fight, when ready), Fire Blast and Frostbolt; out of combat it puts your armor up and conjures water, food and a mana gem. Frost Nova, Polymorph, Blink and Mana (gem / Evocation / drink) keys, and rune restock at reagent vendors. /mage
